cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ZPE-Geo, please cite this repository record.
type: software
title: "ZPE-Geo: Deterministic geospatial trajectory codec with H3 spatial indexing"
authors:
  - name: "Zer0pa (Pty) Ltd"
    email: architects@zer0pa.ai
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: https://github.com/Zer0pa/ZPE-Geo
url: https://github.com/Zer0pa/ZPE-Geo
license-url: https://github.com/Zer0pa/ZPE-Geo/blob/main/LICENSE
abstract: >-
  ZPE-Geo is a deterministic geospatial trajectory codec that compresses
  movement traces using 8-compass direction tokenisation, magnitude
  quantisation, speed quantisation, and run-length encoding. H3 hexagonal
  spatial indexing is built at encode time to support spatial-range queries
  on the compressed representation. Applicable domains include AIS vessel
  tracking, AV telemetry, fleet telematics, and logistics trajectory storage.
keywords:
  - geospatial trajectories
  - deterministic codec
  - trajectory compression
  - H3 spatial indexing
  - AIS
  - AV telemetry
  - compass-8
  - run-length encoding
